WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.350
- So, everybody is sad

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:03.190
that "This Is Us" is coming to an end.

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.070
So, are you feeling kind
of bittersweet about it?

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:06.150
Like, it's a great cast,

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:07.720
but are you excited
about doing new things?

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.230
- I mean, look, I'll be honest.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.220
For me, I don't really
work with anybody but Mandy

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.240
'cause I'm deceased in the present day.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.279
- Oh, that's true, that's true!

00:00:14.279 --> 00:00:15.112
- So, I never work with the kids.

00:00:15.112 --> 00:00:15.950
- But you see everyone, right?

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:17.170
- No, no.
- Oh my gosh, that's weird.

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:18.840
- I see them when we do press.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:19.673
- [Kelly] Oh!

00:00:19.673 --> 00:00:21.200
- So the thing is like, they'll be on set.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.570
Wherever we are, they'll
just kind of group together

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:24.630
and inside joke, inside joke.

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:27.150
And I'm lost dead dad, I
have no idea what's going on.

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:29.210
- I'm lost dead dad. (laughs)

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:32.730
- For me, it's like, yes,
it is a little bittersweet

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:33.563
to leave the group.

00:00:33.563 --> 00:00:35.150
But for me, it's the crew.

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:36.420
It's always the crew.

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:38.680
I mean, you spend day
after day with, you know,

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.410
the people that you're with all the time.

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:41.940
You see 'em, you walk past 'em,

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:45.270
you know their kid's names,
you know everything about 'em.

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:46.620
And then it's just gone and done.

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:47.720
- Yeah.
- And you move on.

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:48.650
- It is true though.

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:51.150
I still see the crew
from like, 20 years ago

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.200
when I won "American Idol."

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.230
I still know the crew

00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:55.513
and I run into them at awards
shows and stuff. It's so crazy

00:00:55.513 --> 00:00:56.970
'cause we've all grown
up together for 20 years.

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:58.550
And those are the people that you see,

00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:00.120
and you'll still see on
different productions.

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:01.030
- Yep, absolutely.

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:02.430
Yeah.
- Yeah, that is true.

